  <item>
    <title>S25 E29 四个外地来沪人员的对谈</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6886c949a9dec925007b6bfe</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6886c949a9dec925007b6bfe</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 28 Jul 2025 00:51:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目是做客史炎老师播客 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/643d5699ea2628837e622346" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/643d5699ea2628837e622346"><span>都在酒里了</span></a><span> 的一期对谈，本期节目除了作为安徽人的我，还有身为河北人的史炎，以及两位BBS时代的老朋友，教上海话的山东人马路 和 湖南人学妹cmm来聊一聊从他乡变成故乡的上海。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这座特别的城市，既有海纳百川的包容，又有井水不犯河水的边界感，相信你们听这期的时候会听到这座城的呓语——上海：你准备呆多久，我该准备咖啡还是陪伴你一生…</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏰时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="726">00:12:06</a>册那，是洋泾浜呀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1804">00:30:04</a>魔都初印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3566">00:59:26</a>卖给上海人？卖给上海的人？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4005">01:06:45</a>i人天堂，边界感是城市默契</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4315">01:11:55</a> 城的魔力转圈圈，爱你爱到每个细节黑夜白天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5860">01:37:40</a> 文化共建：呼吸同一片空的气息，也拥抱在一起</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjryAeZLAwofX66sKJx_I86oyg5z.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>👆四位交大同学用手势摆出SJTU（从左到右依次为生菜、马路、史炎、cmm）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi6QyvwJHRVwKW_1MkkZsF8VFnPW.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>👆2003年马路和试点班同学在只有东方明珠的陆家嘴</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FukkVkBn67yfr07DH_aba66BZ9gb.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>👆2004年马路在正在播放宝贝对不起的徐太</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期制作：竹取赫夜子</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6638714f0d564095f98db627/ltlyRKYXaun66uvpLmiI32QLbXP_.m4a" length="96186122" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:38:43</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnvN_fPiTjkek1hg8R0kcGLrZTbz.png"/>
