    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvtNHWr_IlBaaT7ISTBfi1N0IeOA.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>前阵子听了半拿铁的一期播客 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/62382c1103bea1ebfffa1c00" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/62382c1103bea1ebfffa1c00"><span>No.113 “蛇口之父” 袁庚</span></a><span> ，里面提到在深圳有个改革开放展览馆，就种了个草，于是最近趁着出差深圳，去实地打卡了一下，感想都在本期内容里了.....</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="73">01:13</a> "蛇口之父" 袁庚的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">09:30</a> 当年的蛇口，就是今天的深圳市的核心区域</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="725">12:05</a> 预期太高带来的心理落差</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1297">21:37</a> 从光明日报的社论开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1422">23:42</a> 当年宝安的农民年收入只有 100 多块</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1601">26:41</a> 80年的国家进出口管委会副主任...</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1844">30:44</a> 南方谈话之前到底是发生了什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2095">34:55</a> 1992年，广东立下了flag，用20年时间赶超亚洲四小龙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2323">38:43</a> 深圳的特殊气质</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2516">41:56</a> 上价值</span></p><span></span><p><span>添加小助手：pmcyz01 备注：播客 即可加入本播客听友群。</span></p>]]></description>
