  <item>
    <title>S25 E15 从东升西降说到个人的选择与努力</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67efe541f9578163d605efae</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67efe541f9578163d605efae</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 04 Apr 2025 14:11:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这两天贸易大战升级，恰好最近和以前研究生的室友同学聊天，从“东升西降”的话题开始，后面引发了我的一点思考，简单聊聊大时代下普通人的选择与努力。&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目爹味预警......</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> 回顾2015的创业大潮，竟是十年历史高点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="460">07:40</a> 一位投资人的极度失望情绪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="647">10:47</a> 选择大于努力？我这些年都是反其道而行之</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="800">13:20</a> 一路走来，几乎每一个选择都是偶然的结果</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="970">16:10</a> 一命二运三风水，四修功德五读书</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> 其实个人并没有多少选择 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1120">18:40</a> 无论花多少力气，选择可能依然是“盲目”的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1340">22:20</a> 努力是“有的选”的前提&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1470">24:30</a> 努力是可能是个人除了烧香以外，唯一能做的事情&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>添加小助手vx: pmcyz01，即可加入听友群。&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
